{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50355","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 八、玉女泉咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 八、玉女泉咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"用（周）人祭滛（瑶）水，黍稷信非馨。\n西豹追河伯，蛟龙遂隐形。\n红粧随洛浦，绿鬓逐浮萍。\n尚有销金冶，何曾玉女灵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}